{"title":"1985 AJHSME Problems/Problem 5","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/e/7/be7cfa12c227395d9742e20407567d808601a3b2.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy] unitsize(13); draw((0,0)--(20,0)); draw((0,0)--(0,15)); draw((0,3)--(-1,3)); draw((0,6)--(-1,6)); draw((0,9)--(-1,9)); draw((0,12)--(-1,12)); draw((0,15)--(-1,15)); fill((2,0)--(2,15)--(3,15)--(3,0)--cycle,black); fill((4,0)--(4,12)--(5,12)--(5,0)--cycle,black); fill((6,0)--(6,9)--(7,9)--(7,0)--cycle,black); fill((8,0)--(8,9)--(9,9)--(9,0)--cycle,black); fill((10,0)--(10,15)--(11,15)--(11,0)--cycle,black); label(&quot;A&quot;,(2.5,-.5),S); label(&quot;B&quot;,(4.5,-.5),S); label(&quot;C&quot;,(6.5,-.5),S); label(&quot;D&quot;,(8.5,-.5),S); label(&quot;F&quot;,(10.5,-.5),S); label(&quot;Grade&quot;,(15,-.5),S); label(&quot;$1$&quot;,(-1,3),W); label(&quot;$2$&quot;,(-1,6),W); label(&quot;$3$&quot;,(-1,9),W); label(&quot;$4$&quot;,(-1,12),W); label(&quot;$5$&quot;,(-1,15),W); [/asy]\" width=\"475\" height=\"368\" />\n</p><p>The bar graph shows the grades in a mathematics class for the last grading period.  If A, B, C, and D are satisfactory grades, what fraction of the grades shown in the graph are satisfactory?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/6/5/065b095356f1179186c2fe509fc843f9e5872ba3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A)}\\ \\frac{1}{2} \\qquad \\text{(B)}\\ \\frac{2}{3} \\qquad \\text{(C)}\\ \\frac{3}{4} \\qquad \\text{(D)}\\ \\frac{4}{5} \\qquad \\text{(E)}\\ \\frac{9}{10}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"358\" height=\"38\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/c/4/ac4dfc1ed3688b498cc8ab00b4903ea3576e23a0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5 + 4 + 3 + 3 + 5 = 20$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"179\" height=\"15\" /> students in the class, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/b/8/cb8b95a98e2e8ef6a8276a76f3148f5e69047ce1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5 + 4 + 3 + 3 = 15$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"147\" height=\"15\" /> received satisfactory grades.  So <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/1/4/114b075afdb14b79899eb1f0e3f7b88ca7c1c74e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{15}{20}=\\boxed{\\textbf{(C)}\\ \\frac{3}{4}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -19px\" width=\"107\" height=\"49\" /> of the class received satisfactory grades.\n</p><p>~<a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Shunyipanda&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Shunyipanda (page does not exist)\">shunyipanda</a>, edited by j314andrews\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/c/4/ac4dfc1ed3688b498cc8ab00b4903ea3576e23a0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5 + 4 + 3 + 3 + 5 = 20$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"179\" height=\"15\" /> students in the class, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> did not receive satisfactory grades.  That is, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/f/60f9bf257927904160f89b930832ae25ee52bb9f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{5}{20} = \\frac{1}{4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"61\" height=\"38\" /> of the students did not receive satisfactory grades, and thus <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/a/09ae16be365ef7c6f5f48e7bc27adf2e70c74859.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1 - \\frac{1}{4} = \\boxed{\\textbf{(C)}\\ \\frac{3}{4}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -19px\" width=\"129\" height=\"49\" /> did.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/5KwEd-yul00\">https://youtu.be/5KwEd-yul00</a>\n</p><p>~savannahsolver\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME\" title=\"1985 AJHSME\">1985 AJHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems\" title=\"1985 AJHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1985 AJHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=42&amp;year=1985\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1985 AJHSME Problems/Problem 4\">Problem 4</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1985 AJHSME Problems/Problem 6\">Problem 6</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1985 AJHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1985 AJHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•